SUMMARY:September ART Crawl: Tour 3 Queen West private galleries/spaces ($
 10 per person)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe will *start up* our monthly **Art C
 rawls** once again!\n\n***Please read everything over first.***\n\n\\*\\*\
 \*Our only ART Crawl in September will be on Saturday 5th (1pm-3pm)\n\n14-
 15 people/members each time.\n\n**About once each month** on a *Saturday a
 fternoon*.\n\n**$10 per person.**\n\n**Sent via e-transfer when you signup
 /rsvp. I'm not able to HOLD space for you.**\n\n***--We will visit 3 diffe
 rent*** (downtown/west end/east end) galleries each month **(with short wa
 lks between each one)**\n\nEach month will be different galleries and/or a
 rtist run centres.\n\n\\*\\*We'll meet the Gallery owners/artists/director
 s--who will lead us in tours and conversation at each stop.\n\nNO weather 
 cancellations---**we will carry on!**\n\nNO cancellations/no refunds or an
 y re-scheduling...if you cannot make it.\n\n\\-\\-\\-Check your calendars 
 and PLAN ahead if you can join us\\-\\-and please arrive on time\\. We're 
 not able to wait for you\\.\n\nAre you Interested in ART/artists--**and le
 arning/visiting the exceptional local downtown galleries we have in Toront
 o? With other MEETUP members**\n\nSaturday September 5th (1pm-3pm)\n\nOnce
  I have 14-15 **confirmations** from Meetup members (you)--I will email yo
 u the location of our ART Crawl!!\n\n**Our first stop**. Queen/Ossington a
 rea (we then head WEST)\n\nIf interested\, please email me $10.\n\nInclude
  your first name only\, and email address for a reply.\n\n**I will then co
 nfirm you.**\n\nAnd will firm up our itinerary with you in a few days.\n\n
 See you on Saturday September 5th--if you're confirmed--watch for an email
  directly from me.\n\n***We will do this again in October*** and ongoing\,
  as we find some interesting spaces and exhibitions.\n\nEach month will be
  posted separately. $10 each time.\n\n**September 2026 is posted now only.
 **\n\nYou can email me directly here:\n\ntorontoisculture@gmail\,com\n\nGr
 eg\n\nThanks\n\n(Please understand I have NO space for any guests you may 
 wish to bring with you. I am limited in group size based on the GALLERY in
 structions)\n\nIf you miss out on the ART CRAWL--please check out ALL the 
 other upcoming MEETUP events--it's always helpful to me to know who the ac
 tive/engaged/interested members are.
