SUMMARY:ROM:  Weston International Award--Evening with Hanif Abdurraqib ($
 20)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n{ This Author EVENT is Sold-Out }\n\nA
 lways a HOT ticket--an important (international) AUTHOR Talk. At the ROM.\
 n\n($15-$20 only!!)\n\nAmerican author **Hanif Abdurraqib has won the 2026
  Weston International Award. $75\,000**\n\n**Overview--**\n\nThe evening w
 ill feature **Hanif Abdurraquib** delivering a talk and having an in-depth
  conversation with **CBC ARTS.**\n\n\\*\\*\\*Join us on Monday\, September
  14 at the Royal Ontario Museum\, for an evening with the 2026 Weston Inte
 rnational Award winner\, hosted by Ali Hassan of CBC’s Canada Reads.\n\n
 **Hanif Abdurraqib is an American memoirist and poet known for his distinc
 tive style of cultural and artistic criticism through the lens of music\,*
 * **sport\, and contemporary American issues**. In a creative and wide-ran
 ging talk\, he will bring his unique and rare intellect to the role of non
 fiction in our society\, and his relationship to it as someone from an unc
 onventional background.\n\nHe’ll then sit down for wide-ranging and free
 -wheeling conversation with a member of the award jury and author Tessa Mc
 Watt. Jurors said his “work sings and stings and brings truths\, both pe
 rsonal and communal\, as he voices culture and its complexities with bold\
 , compassionate lyricism and a real sense of love\,” and that is what he
  will bring to the stage.\n\n***The $75\,000 prize is a companion to the e
 xisting Hilary Weston Writers' Trust Prize for Nonfiction\, which is award
 ed annually to a Canadian author for a single work of nonfiction.***\n\nTh
 e Weston International Award recognizes the career achievement of an inter
 national author for a body of nonfiction work. Eligible international auth
 ors must have published at least three books of outstanding literary merit
 \, in the genre of nonfiction\, that are written in English or else widely
  available in translation.\n\n**Ticket link here:**\n\nhttps://www.eventbr
 ite.ca/e/the-weston-international-award-presents-an-evening-with-hanif-abd
 urraqib-tickets-1983560042483?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\n**Recent interview on C
 BC:**\n\nhttps://www.cbc.ca/books/american-author-hanif-abdurraqib-wins-75
 k-weston-international-award-for-career-achievement-in-nonfiction-9.723579
 6\n\nSEE you there.
