SUMMARY:JAIPUR Literature Festival:  Toronto edition
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nThe **Jaipur Literature Festival**—h
 eld annually in the historic Pink City of Jaipur\, Rajasthan—is celebrat
 ed worldwide as the **“greatest literary show on Earth.”**\n\nhttps://
 www.jaipurliteraturefestival.org/\n\nThere is NOW---**a TORONTO edition**.
  7 speakers/author interviews\n\n\\*\\*\\*Ticket purchase link/author bios
 /schedule is below.\n\nGeneral admission seating (you'll sit in the same s
 eat all day)\n\n**DAY Pass** is $62 (for everything)\n\n**INDIVIDUAL sessi
 ons**/interviews are $15 (each)\n\nhttps://tolive.com/Event-Details-Page/r
 eference/JLF-Toronto-2026?utm_medium=crosspromo&utm_source=partner&utm_cam
 paign=jlf2026&utm_content=torontoisculture\n\n**JLF Toronto returns this S
 eptember\, bringing together acclaimed writers\, thinkers\, artists\, and 
 cultural leaders for a vibrant celebration of literature\, ideas\, and dia
 logue.**\n\nJLF Toronto\, in association with TO Live\, is part of the int
 ernationally renowned Jaipur Literature Festival’s global series\, produ
 ced by Teamwork Arts. The festival brings audiences into conversations tha
 t travel across cultures\, disciplines\, and borders\, exploring timely th
 emes of migration\, identity\, heritage\, gender\, democracy\, medicine\, 
 and the arts.\n\n***Celebrating the richness and diversity of South Asian 
 literary culture while embracing global perspectives***\, JLF Toronto crea
 tes a space for meaningful exchange\, fresh ideas\, and engaging conversat
 ions that inspire curiosity and connection.\n\n*Whether you're a lifelong 
 reader\, an aspiring writer\, or simply curious about the world\, JLF Toro
 nto invites you to discover new voices\, challenge perspectives\, and join
  the conversation.*\n\n*Each author will speak for 45 minutes (on stage)*\
 n\n**Featured authors:**\n\n* Tanya Talaga\n* John Vaillant\n* Anosh Irani
 \n* Vikram Vij\n* Alka Joshi\n* Martin Puchner\n* Dr. Nikky-Guninder Kaur 
 Singh\n\nJoin us for an extraordinary weekend where literature meets polit
 ics\, history meets imagination\, and diverse voices come together to cele
 brate the power of words.\n\nBIO and SCHEDULE here:\n\nhttps://www.tolive.
 com/Event-Details-Page/reference/JLF-Toronto-2026\n\nDAY PASS: $62 (which 
 I have)\n\nINDIVDUAL SESSION: $15\n\n(LUNCH is NOT included. I plan to bri
 ng my own lunch and enjoy in at the PARK/Berczy Park/Dog Fountain)\n\nSee 
 you there! Questions?\n\n(When this event is done--we head to Alliance Fra
 ncaise for a concert with artists from PERU & IRAN)
